	<item>
		<title>Google is working on a new AI chip designed to make Gemini more efficient</title>
		<link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/20/google-is-working-on-a-new-ai-chip-designed-to-make-gemini-more-efficient/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Maxwell Zeff]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 17:04:11 +0000</pubDate>
		<category><![CDATA[AI]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://techcrunch.com/?p=3096210</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[<p>Google is developing a new inference accelerator for Gemini.</p>
<img src="https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/gemini-icon.jpg?resize=1024%2C521&#038;ssl=1" alt="Gemini icon" width="1024" height="521" />
]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<figure id="attachment_3096211" class="wp-caption alignnone">
<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="wp-image-3096211 size-full" src="https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tpu-rack.jpg?w=1024&#038;ssl=1" alt="A rack of Google TPU accelerators inside a datacenter" width="1024" height="576" srcset="https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tpu-rack.jpg?w=1536&#038;ssl=1 1536w, https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/tpu-rack.jpg?w=768&#038;ssl=1 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />
<figcaption class="wp-caption-text">谷歌数据中心内的 TPU 机架。Image Credits: Google</figcaption>
</figure>
<p>Google is building a purpose-built inference chip so that serving Gemini costs less per token.</p>
<figure>
<img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/inference-cost-chart.png" alt="Inference cost per million tokens" width="1200" height="675" />
<figcaption>推理成本随芯片代际下降的曲线，纵轴为每百万 token 的美元成本。</figcaption>
</figure>
<p>The company declined to share a shipping date.</p>
